WEBVTT

00:34.670 --> 00:36.290
<b>Flöte Mascarail!</b>

00:36.290 --> 00:39.330
<b>You haven't seen the last of me!
Until the next battle!</b>

00:45.420 --> 00:46.830
<b>Empress Karen...</b>

00:46.830 --> 00:48.960
<b>We've managed to hold them off.</b>

00:52.540 --> 00:54.460
<b>Her Majesty gave us an imperial order.</b>

00:54.920 --> 00:59.960
<b>We must search for Terakomari as we
make our way to Daydream Paradise.</b>

01:00.460 --> 01:02.330
<b>I'm worried about Miss Komari!</b>

01:02.330 --> 01:04.210
<b>Let's get moving, Miss Delphyne!</b>

01:04.210 --> 01:05.170
<b>Wait.</b>

01:05.170 --> 01:07.290
<b>Do you know where Terakomari is?</b>

01:07.580 --> 01:11.250
<b>Yes. I have a transmitter attached
to Miss Komari; you see.</b>

01:14.670 --> 01:16.540
<b>You're quite well-prepared.</b>

01:18.130 --> 01:20.330
<b>I always keep one on her.</b>

01:21.670 --> 01:22.790
<b>I see.</b>

01:24.790 --> 01:27.960
<b>Now then, let's review the current situation.</b>

01:28.250 --> 01:31.670
<b>We've made it all the way to the doorstep
of Daydream Paradise.</b>

01:31.670 --> 01:33.380
<b>And to be frank,</b>

01:33.380 --> 01:37.040
<b>it's practically a miracle that we haven't
gotten attacked by the enemy thus far.</b>

01:37.040 --> 01:41.960
<b>Lady Nelia, what is the plan once we
get inside Daydream Paradise?</b>

01:41.960 --> 01:44.380
<b>We uncover its secrets, of course.</b>

01:45.130 --> 01:47.960
<b>That's where all the darkness behind
Gerra-Aruka is concentrated.</b>

01:48.170 --> 01:49.830
<b>What do you mean by "darkness"?</b>

01:50.540 --> 01:53.790
<b>Madhart has imprisoned the supporters
of the Arukan royal family</b>

01:53.790 --> 01:56.460
<b>and is performing heinous
experiments on them.</b>

01:59.250 --> 02:00.540
<b>Say, Vill?</b>

02:00.880 --> 02:02.920
<b>Can I order anything I want?</b>

02:04.790 --> 02:26.750
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

03:33.130 --> 03:38.040
<b>The Dream-Crushing Paradise</b>

03:35.920 --> 03:38.040
<b>Human experimentation, huh?</b>

03:38.420 --> 03:42.130
<b>I've been sent on multiple
recon missions in this area and...</b>

03:42.460 --> 03:43.790
<b>I've heard them myself.</b>

03:43.790 --> 03:47.460
<b>The sound of humans screaming
from the depths of Daydream Paradise.</b>

03:48.170 --> 03:52.080
<b>Rumor also has it that ritual articles are
being smuggled into Daydream Paradise.</b>

03:52.080 --> 03:54.670
<b>There are exceptional cases where
individuals who were tortured</b>

03:54.670 --> 03:56.960
<b>by ritual articles underwent
spiritual evolution</b>

03:56.960 --> 03:59.710
<b>and obtained the Core Implosion ability.</b>

03:59.710 --> 04:01.250
<b>Or so I've heard.</b>

04:01.250 --> 04:03.920
<b>Core Implosion grants enough power
to move the very stars.</b>

04:03.920 --> 04:07.460
<b>And just activating it is enough
to tear the land apart.</b>

04:07.790 --> 04:10.250
<b>Using military force like that
to bring the world to its knees</b>

04:10.250 --> 04:12.460
<b>certainly sounds like something
Madhart would do.</b>

04:12.460 --> 04:14.500
<b>I like omelette rice with mushrooms,</b>

04:14.500 --> 04:16.830
<b>but it's hard to say no to
the hamburger omelette rice...</b>

04:16.830 --> 04:21.380
<b>In any case, we can't let Madhart
continue on unchecked like this.</b>

04:21.380 --> 04:23.960
<b>We will reveal the secrets of
Daydream Paradise.</b>

04:23.960 --> 04:24.920
<b>Okay!</b>

04:25.080 --> 04:28.080
<b>I'll have mushroom omelette rice
and seafood omelette rice!</b>

04:28.920 --> 04:30.420
<b>Hey, Komari.</b>

04:30.420 --> 04:32.670
<b>Are you even listening to me?</b>

04:32.670 --> 04:34.250
<b>Huh? Sorry.</b>

04:34.250 --> 04:36.000
<b>I was totally focused on the omelette rice...</b>

04:36.000 --> 04:37.670
<b>Jeez! You're so honest!</b>

04:37.670 --> 04:39.750
<b>But I guess that's another
wonderful thing about you!</b>

04:39.750 --> 04:42.040
<b>Karla, you were listening, right?
Please tell me you-</b>

04:45.380 --> 04:46.960
<b>Don't play dumb, ya fruitcake!</b>

04:46.960 --> 04:48.880
<b>Wu-wuz goin' on?!</b>

04:48.880 --> 04:50.130
<b>Is it morning already?!</b>

04:50.130 --> 04:52.080
<b>It's still nighttime.
</b><b>Excuse me! I'd like to order.</b><b></b>

04:52.080 --> 04:54.580
<b>Miss Karla, were you listening?</b>

04:54.580 --> 04:56.000
<b>Um... good morning?</b>

04:56.000 --> 04:57.880
<b>I'm telling you, it's nighttime!
</b><b>These guys are useless.</b><b></b>

05:02.290 --> 05:04.880
<b>Now they've done it, the impudent fools.</b>

05:05.670 --> 05:07.920
<b>Can you hear me, Rainsworth?</b>

05:07.920 --> 05:09.920
<b>Mr. President! Are you okay?</b>

05:10.380 --> 05:11.830
<b>Perfectly so.</b>

05:11.830 --> 05:14.000
<b>More importantly, here are your orders.</b>

05:14.500 --> 05:20.040
<b>I want you to continue your pursuit of
Nelia Cunningham and Terakomari Gandesblood.</b>

05:20.040 --> 05:21.000
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

05:21.000 --> 05:23.960
<b>And while you're at it,
I need you to do something for me.</b>

05:25.880 --> 05:28.580
<b>I'm going to mobilize the Daydream Unit.</b>

05:29.330 --> 05:32.460
<b>Once the fools have fallen into
Daydream Paradise,</b>

05:32.460 --> 05:34.460
<b>I'm leaving you to take command.</b>

05:40.880 --> 05:43.830
<b>Very assertive for someone who just woke up!</b>

05:45.500 --> 05:48.460
<b>Oh no, this isn't good!
How'd they find us?!</b>

05:48.460 --> 05:49.960
<b>Something is definitely off.</b>

05:49.960 --> 05:52.790
<b>They shouldn't have been able to
track us down so quickly.</b>

05:55.960 --> 05:58.670
<b>This is the end of the line, Nelia!</b>

05:58.670 --> 06:01.790
<b>There's nobody who would
bother taking your side</b>

06:01.790 --> 06:05.000
<b>after you betrayed your own nation!</b>

06:05.000 --> 06:05.880
<b>Lady Nelia!</b>

06:06.880 --> 06:08.290
<b>We'll retreat for the time being!</b>

06:18.130 --> 06:19.330
<b>What is this?</b>

06:19.330 --> 06:22.630
<b>It's the vampire maid's poison gas
that only kills men!</b>

06:22.630 --> 06:24.420
<b>Lady Nelia, now's our chance!</b>

06:24.420 --> 06:25.290
<b>Right!</b>

06:29.170 --> 06:31.460
<b>Come. We must hurry, Lady Komari!</b>

06:31.460 --> 06:33.080
<b>Let's follow after Lady Cunningham!</b>

06:33.080 --> 06:35.750
<b>Wait a minute! We can't leave Karla behind!</b>

06:36.130 --> 06:37.540
<b>Forget about her, she's already dead.</b>

06:37.540 --> 06:38.880
<b>She died?!</b>

06:41.880 --> 06:42.790
<b>Vill!</b>

06:48.830 --> 06:53.000
<b>You inferior breeds are just garbage that
stand no chance against the Warblades!</b>

06:53.000 --> 06:54.880
<b>After the Mulnite Empire takes control,</b>

06:54.880 --> 06:57.710
<b>all vampires will be slaves to the Warblades.</b>

06:58.000 --> 07:01.080
<b>And I'm going to make you my personal slave.</b>

07:01.290 --> 07:03.250
<b>Since, if nothing else, your looks are top-class!</b>

07:03.250 --> 07:04.630
<b>Seriously...?
</b><b>Since, if nothing else, your looks are top-class!</b><b></b>

07:05.750 --> 07:07.210
<b>It'll give me something to brag about
to the other Eight Illustrious Generals!</b>

07:07.210 --> 07:08.630
<b>Shut up. You sleazebag!
</b><b>It'll give me something to brag about</b><b>
</b><b>to the other Eight Illustrious Generals!</b><b></b>

07:08.630 --> 07:09.330
<b>Shut up. You sleazebag!</b>

07:10.880 --> 07:13.080
<b>Well, that's one down.</b>

07:13.960 --> 07:16.790
<b>Stop it!</b>

07:19.580 --> 07:20.580
<b>What the hell is this?!</b>

07:20.580 --> 07:21.880
<b>You rusty piece of scum.</b>

07:24.330 --> 07:27.830
<b>I'm not letting you have free reign any longer.</b>

07:28.290 --> 07:29.880
<b>D-Delphyne!</b>

07:31.080 --> 07:32.710
<b>Die!</b>

07:36.960 --> 07:38.380
<b>Stupid maggot!</b>

07:44.250 --> 07:45.630
<b>Oh yeah!</b>

07:46.580 --> 07:49.210
<b>Your Excellency! I'm glad you're all right!</b>

07:49.210 --> 07:50.080
<b>You guys!</b>

07:50.080 --> 07:52.000
<b>Miss Komari! Are you okay?</b>

07:52.420 --> 07:54.080
<b>Sakuna?! Why are you here?</b>

07:54.080 --> 07:56.330
<b>I came rushing after you.</b>

07:56.330 --> 07:59.540
<b>Miss Delphyne and I are part of
the attacker group, after all.</b>

08:01.920 --> 08:03.630
<b>Oh, thank you!</b>

08:03.630 --> 08:05.330
<b>U-um, Miss Komari?!</b>

08:05.960 --> 08:06.670
<b>Sakuna!</b>

08:06.670 --> 08:07.790
<b>Sakuna!
</b><b>Lady Komari.</b><b></b>

08:07.790 --> 08:10.460
<b>Don't you have something
you wish to say to me as well?</b>

08:10.460 --> 08:11.500
<b>Oh, right!</b>

08:11.500 --> 08:12.920
<b>Is your leg okay, Vill?!</b>

08:12.920 --> 08:15.330
<b>Everything's okay since I was
healed by the Dark Core,</b>

08:15.330 --> 08:16.540
<b>but more importantly,</b>

08:16.540 --> 08:20.330
<b>I believe it's only proper that you should
reward your maid with a hug, too.</b>

08:20.880 --> 08:22.330
<b>F-fine then...</b>

08:22.880 --> 08:26.250
<b>Miss Komari!
I'm afraid there isn't time for this.</b>

08:26.250 --> 08:27.330
<b>Good point!</b>

08:27.790 --> 08:30.830
<b>You have somewhere else to be, right?</b>

08:31.330 --> 08:33.250
<b>Let us handle things here.</b>

08:33.250 --> 08:35.000
<b>Please go on ahead.</b>

08:36.130 --> 08:39.380
<b>Oh gosh! I've always wanted
the chance to say a line like that!</b>

08:39.380 --> 08:42.130
<b>Pretty sure that's also a death flag, though...</b>

08:42.130 --> 08:43.920
<b>Let's get moving, Lady Komari.</b>

08:43.920 --> 08:44.920
<b>Okay.</b>

08:46.170 --> 08:47.580
<b>That's right.</b>

08:48.000 --> 08:51.420
<b>Nelia and I have a destination
that we must reach.</b>

08:52.330 --> 08:55.330
<b>The resort area that's become
a vortex of Gerra-Aruka's darkness.</b>

08:56.380 --> 08:58.210
<b>Daydream Paradise.</b>

09:09.170 --> 09:10.460
<b>This is barbaric!</b>

09:10.920 --> 09:12.670
<b>We don't want senseless war!</b>

09:12.670 --> 09:14.670
<b>Down with Madhart!</b>

09:15.000 --> 09:16.750
<b>Enough already!
</b><b>Give us our peaceful country back!</b><b></b>

09:16.750 --> 09:17.540
<b>Give us our peaceful country back!</b>

09:17.540 --> 09:19.000
<b>What a sight!</b>

09:19.000 --> 09:20.380
<b>We might actually be witnessing the
downfall of Gerra-Aruka as it happens!</b>

09:20.380 --> 09:22.330
<b>No more war!
</b><b>We might actually be witnessing the</b><b>
</b><b>downfall of Gerra-Aruka as it happens!</b><b></b>

09:22.330 --> 09:23.000
<b>We might actually be witnessing the
downfall of Gerra-Aruka as it happens!</b>

09:23.000 --> 09:24.960
<b>Um, Miss Melca?</b>

09:24.960 --> 09:27.960
<b>What are we even doing in Gerra-Aruka?</b>

09:28.130 --> 09:30.880
<b>As part of the Mulnite branch,
we shouldn't be covering this, right?</b>

09:30.880 --> 09:33.170
<b>We're here to get dibs on the big scoop</b>

09:33.170 --> 09:35.170
<b>that's causing chaos for
the entire world, of course!</b>

09:35.170 --> 09:36.460
<b>That's impossible.</b>

09:36.460 --> 09:40.000
<b>You know the Six Nations News gets
treated like tabloid trash around here.</b>

09:40.000 --> 09:41.580
<b>Don't worry your little head.</b>

09:41.580 --> 09:44.540
<b>Because that electrovideo box
you've got there will capture the truth!</b>

09:44.540 --> 09:49.290
<b>All of the footage you're recording right now
is being broadcast in real time</b>

09:49.290 --> 09:52.210
<b>across the world as a
true chronicle of these events!</b>

09:52.670 --> 09:55.750
<b>Alrighty. It's time for us to get
the scoop of the century</b>

09:55.750 --> 09:58.670
<b>by blowing the lid on
Gerra-Aruka's big secret!</b>

10:08.080 --> 10:10.000
<b>What a pain in the ass.</b>

10:10.000 --> 10:11.830
<b>Friggin' vampires!</b>

10:12.920 --> 10:14.880
<b>Give me the latest on Nelia Cunningham.</b>

10:14.880 --> 10:17.460
<b>She'll be arriving at
Daydream Paradise shortly.</b>

10:17.460 --> 10:19.500
<b>Then I'll catch up soon.</b>

10:23.630 --> 10:25.000
<b>No way...</b>

10:25.000 --> 10:26.790
<b>I won't let you reach Miss Komari...</b>

10:28.380 --> 10:30.210
<b>You worms have zero chance.</b>

10:30.210 --> 10:32.830
<b>Gandesblood will be dead soon enough.</b>

10:33.290 --> 10:37.790
<b>We already have Abercrombie's unit waiting
to ambush her at Daydream Paradise.</b>

10:37.790 --> 10:39.630
<b>Abercrombie?</b>

10:40.670 --> 10:42.290
<b>I remember him.</b>

10:43.210 --> 10:46.380
<b>I mean... he was so strong...</b>

10:46.380 --> 10:48.500
<b>Huh? What are you saying?</b>

10:48.500 --> 10:50.130
<b>But guess what?</b>

10:50.670 --> 10:52.250
<b>I won.</b>

10:54.920 --> 10:56.250
<b>Whoa.</b>

10:56.250 --> 10:58.750
<b>What am I looking at here?</b>

10:59.750 --> 11:01.580
<b>It's Abercrombie.</b>

11:02.830 --> 11:06.170
<b>From what I can tell, this is
Lady Memoir's handy work.</b>

11:06.170 --> 11:08.420
<b>Sakuna?! She was here?</b>

11:08.420 --> 11:09.420
<b>No.</b>

11:09.960 --> 11:12.500
<b>Lady Memoir once got an order
from the Empress</b>

11:12.500 --> 11:15.330
<b>and went around trying to
ignite wars in various countries.</b>

11:15.960 --> 11:18.750
<b>She killed Abercrombie during that time,</b>

11:18.750 --> 11:22.290
<b>and used her Core Implosion ability,
"Wheels of Asterism,"</b>

11:22.290 --> 11:24.670
<b>to make it so she could
control him at any time.</b>

11:24.920 --> 11:27.080
<b>Then, she turned Abercrombie
against his own men</b>

11:27.080 --> 11:30.830
<b>that were waiting here to ambush us,
and they all wiped each other out.</b>

11:30.830 --> 11:32.210
<b>How dreadful...</b>

11:32.210 --> 11:34.210
<b>In any case, this is lucky for us.</b>

11:34.830 --> 11:39.040
<b>Now we can get into Daydream Paradise
without even breaking a sweat.</b>

11:42.750 --> 11:44.170
<b>There are people in here.</b>

11:44.170 --> 11:47.420
<b>So this is the place that Madhart
calls Daydream Paradise.</b>

11:52.580 --> 11:55.790
<b>I see restraints and ritual articles
with blood smeared on them...</b>

11:56.170 --> 11:57.460
<b>That makes it pretty clear</b>

11:57.460 --> 12:01.130
<b>they were performing human experimentation
using ritual articles here.</b>

12:02.380 --> 12:05.460
<b>For starters, let's look for the keys.
We have to free these people!</b>

12:05.460 --> 12:08.750
<b>Lady Nelia. I have the keys right here.</b>

12:11.330 --> 12:12.880
<b>How did you get those?!</b>

12:12.880 --> 12:14.790
<b>They were lying on the ground
near the entrance.</b>

12:14.790 --> 12:15.960
<b>That's great!</b>

12:15.960 --> 12:17.830
<b>Now we can save everyone!</b>

12:17.830 --> 12:20.750
<b>Do you honestly think
they need to be saved?</b>

12:20.750 --> 12:23.040
<b>What are you saying? Of course I do.</b>

12:23.040 --> 12:24.210
<b>Just give me those key-</b>

12:24.210 --> 12:27.630
<b>They are nothing but fools who
disobeyed the President.</b>

12:27.630 --> 12:28.500
<b>Huh?!</b>

12:28.500 --> 12:30.670
<b>And these keys?</b>

12:30.670 --> 12:33.960
<b>They're meant to
incarcerate you, Lady Nelia.</b>

12:41.630 --> 12:43.540
<b>W-why...?</b>

12:44.630 --> 12:46.670
<b>You...</b>

12:47.290 --> 12:49.540
<b>I am Gertrude.</b>

12:49.540 --> 12:51.880
<b>Eighth Unit Commander...</b>

12:53.040 --> 12:55.460
<b>Gertrude Rainsworth.</b>

12:57.250 --> 12:58.380
<b>Nelia!</b>

12:58.580 --> 12:59.580
<b>Lady Komari!</b>

13:09.210 --> 13:10.210
<b>Vill!</b>

13:13.170 --> 13:15.830
<b>Sucks to be you, Nelia!</b>

13:18.790 --> 13:20.630
<b>Rainsworth...!</b>

13:20.630 --> 13:23.210
<b>What is going on?! Explain!</b>

13:23.460 --> 13:25.540
<b>Say hello to my little sister.</b>

13:25.540 --> 13:28.330
<b>She's been keeping tabs on you
this entire time.</b>

13:29.670 --> 13:31.210
<b>That can't be!</b>

13:31.210 --> 13:33.670
<b>You're supposed to be on my side!</b>

13:33.670 --> 13:35.540
<b>Say something, Gertrude!</b>

13:35.540 --> 13:38.670
<b>Yes. I am on your side, Lady Nelia.</b>

13:38.960 --> 13:40.920
<b>That's not right, is it, Gertrude?</b>

13:43.670 --> 13:45.210
<b>I misspoke.</b>

13:45.210 --> 13:48.080
<b>I am on your side, Lady Nelia,
but in this moment,</b>

13:48.080 --> 13:49.670
<b>we are enemies.</b>

13:51.130 --> 13:53.630
<b>Gertrude... why...?</b>

13:54.040 --> 13:56.880
<b>Watching you up close made me think...</b>

13:57.460 --> 14:00.580
<b>All those people who
badmouthed you behind your back,</b>

14:00.580 --> 14:03.420
<b>all that hard work you did
that went unrewarded,</b>

14:03.420 --> 14:06.630
<b>and all those days you spent
trembling with frustration...</b>

14:07.750 --> 14:11.750
<b>If that continued on for any longer,
I was sure you would fall apart.</b>

14:12.380 --> 14:15.500
<b>Which is why I believe you should just
give up your unreasonable ambitions</b>

14:15.500 --> 14:18.040
<b>and live in peace instead.</b>

14:18.750 --> 14:22.330
<b>President Madhart is striving for world peace.</b>

14:22.330 --> 14:24.920
<b>It's no different from the dream
you want to achieve.</b>

14:24.920 --> 14:26.000
<b>You're wrong!</b>

14:26.000 --> 14:28.540
<b>My way of doing things is different!</b>

14:29.080 --> 14:30.710
<b>B-because...</b>

14:30.710 --> 14:35.380
<b>the world can obtain peace if people
just act in the interest of others.</b>

14:35.380 --> 14:37.580
<b>That's what Yulinne said...</b>

14:40.710 --> 14:43.330
<b>Don't overcomplicate this.</b>

14:43.330 --> 14:46.790
<b>You have a chance to be free
from all forms of suffering.</b>

14:46.790 --> 14:49.420
<b>Just let your absurd dream die.</b>

14:49.420 --> 14:52.000
<b>And become mine.</b>

14:55.380 --> 14:57.540
<b>Nelia's dream is still alive!</b>

14:58.540 --> 14:59.540
<b>Huh?</b>

14:59.830 --> 15:01.830
<b>And there's no way in hell...</b>

15:01.830 --> 15:04.000
<b>a bunch of stupid assholes like you
are going to ruin it!</b>

15:04.750 --> 15:06.420
<b>Hold on.</b>

15:06.420 --> 15:08.920
<b>Let me make sure I heard you right.</b>

15:09.830 --> 15:12.210
<b>Who are you calling stupid?! Huh?!</b>

15:12.210 --> 15:14.290
<b>You! You're a stupid asshole!</b>

15:14.290 --> 15:16.130
<b>My mom told me all I need to know!</b>

15:16.130 --> 15:20.250
<b>She said that lowlifes who treat
other people like tools have no future!</b>

15:20.250 --> 15:21.880
<b>Nelia is a fighter!</b>

15:21.880 --> 15:24.250
<b>And she'll never lose to the likes of you!</b>

15:24.250 --> 15:27.000
<b>So apologize to her right now
and then get lost!</b>

15:27.000 --> 15:28.290
<b>You delusional bastard!</b>

15:28.290 --> 15:29.420
<b>That's enough.</b>

15:29.420 --> 15:31.580
<b>You little bitch!</b>

15:34.920 --> 15:38.290
<b>Dammit! Inferior vampire trash!</b>

15:38.290 --> 15:40.920
<b>What's the matter! Done already?!</b>

15:40.920 --> 15:43.170
<b>Keep talking shit! C'mon!</b>

15:52.880 --> 15:54.710
<b>What are you doing?</b>

15:55.380 --> 15:57.130
<b>Aw hell.</b>

15:57.130 --> 15:58.750
<b>You're still alive?</b>

15:59.790 --> 16:03.000
<b>Miss Komari... she's injured.</b>

16:03.330 --> 16:05.040
<b>Who did it?</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:07.040
<b>Was it you, Mr. Warblade?</b>

16:07.040 --> 16:08.750
<b>The rest of us weren't enough?</b>

16:08.750 --> 16:10.880
<b>You had to go and hurt Miss Komari, too?!</b>

16:12.250 --> 16:15.380
<b>Big Brother! We have more problems
than just this Sapphire wannabe!</b>

16:15.380 --> 16:16.670
<b>It's an enemy attack!</b>

16:16.670 --> 16:18.290
<b>Sakuna Memoir!</b>

16:18.290 --> 16:20.170
<b>What the hell have you done?!</b>

16:20.170 --> 16:23.790
<b>All I did was run after Miss Komari
and they followed me...</b>

16:29.540 --> 16:31.330
<b>Lady Karla Amatsu</b>

16:31.330 --> 16:33.460
<b>and a couple of journalists.</b>

16:35.080 --> 16:36.420
<b>It's over.</b>

16:36.420 --> 16:38.630
<b>You're not getting away with this any longer.</b>

16:38.630 --> 16:42.830
<b>I will stay here to fend off the
Sapphire wannabe and Karla Amatsu.</b>

16:43.500 --> 16:45.710
<b>So you go and take command of
the Daydream Unit!</b>

16:45.710 --> 16:46.750
<b>Right.</b>

16:47.500 --> 16:50.040
<b>Daydream Unit...?</b>

16:50.420 --> 16:53.250
<b>It's a squadron of 5,000 elite soldiers</b>

16:53.250 --> 16:56.380
<b>that President Madhart
developed in total secrecy.</b>

16:56.380 --> 16:58.580
<b>Faure will be conquered in no time.</b>

16:59.330 --> 17:03.420
<b>Nelia. Be a good girl and
just stay put until I come back.</b>

17:03.420 --> 17:05.380
<b>Dust Tail Comet!</b>

17:07.500 --> 17:09.170
<b>Razor Splash!</b>

17:15.500 --> 17:18.750
<b>What tipped you off that I was here?</b>

17:18.750 --> 17:21.790
<b>Actually, the bigger mystery is...</b>

17:22.130 --> 17:24.130
<b>How did you even get in?</b>

17:24.130 --> 17:26.540
<b>Let's not fret over the details.</b>

17:26.920 --> 17:29.210
<b>Just know I took the trouble of
coming all the way here</b>

17:29.210 --> 17:31.080
<b>to recommend that you surrender.</b>

17:32.580 --> 17:36.040
<b>There is no future for Mulnite
and Heavenly Paradise.</b>

17:36.880 --> 17:39.540
<b>You're the one who should
give in to my demands.</b>

17:39.540 --> 17:42.460
<b>You want to know where
the Dark Core is, eh?</b>

17:42.460 --> 17:44.170
<b>Don't make me repeat myself.</b>

17:44.170 --> 17:45.830
<b>There's no way I'd tell you that.</b>

17:45.830 --> 17:48.580
<b>This is depressing, Your Majesty.</b>

17:48.580 --> 17:51.750
<b>Vampires are nothing more than
an inferior species.</b>

17:51.750 --> 17:55.670
<b>They stand no chance against the supreme
might of the Warblades under my command.</b>

17:55.670 --> 17:57.540
<b>Supreme might?</b>

17:57.920 --> 18:01.210
<b>Hard to believe that with the way
your Warblades keep losing.</b>

18:01.210 --> 18:05.210
<b>Except we still have a
very special ace up our sleeve.</b>

18:06.170 --> 18:10.460
<b>A squadron of 5,000 soldiers who
each possess power that's on par</b>

18:10.460 --> 18:12.380
<b>with that of a General.</b>

18:14.880 --> 18:17.130
<b>The Daydream Unit.</b>

18:27.710 --> 18:30.000
<b>N-Nelia...</b>

18:31.630 --> 18:33.040
<b>Sorry.</b>

18:33.040 --> 18:36.540
<b>But would you mind helping me get up?</b>

18:37.750 --> 18:39.630
<b>What for?</b>

18:40.380 --> 18:43.170
<b>So that I can go after Rainsworth.</b>

18:43.170 --> 18:45.580
<b>Everyone's in trouble right now.</b>

18:46.290 --> 18:47.750
<b>I don't get it.</b>

18:48.250 --> 18:51.460
<b>How can you keep making an effort
in this situation?</b>

18:51.880 --> 18:54.290
<b>I really don't want to.</b>

18:54.290 --> 18:57.330
<b>But that doesn't change the fact
I'm obligated to my best.</b>

18:58.170 --> 18:59.960
<b>Yeah, I'm injured.</b>

19:00.250 --> 19:02.080
<b>Yeah, I'm in pain.</b>

19:02.080 --> 19:05.830
<b>But I'm also one of the Seven Crimson Lords.</b>

19:06.750 --> 19:09.790
<b>So giving up isn't an option.</b>

19:09.790 --> 19:11.330
<b>It's impossible.</b>

19:11.330 --> 19:13.670
<b>We're talking about fighting 5,000 troops!</b>

19:13.670 --> 19:18.000
<b>Nobody can say who'd win or lose
until I've actually tried, right?</b>

19:18.000 --> 19:19.420
<b>Well, obviously!</b>

19:19.790 --> 19:22.580
<b>But... I can't do this anymore...</b>

19:23.250 --> 19:25.630
<b>After having been belittled
by so many people,</b>

19:25.630 --> 19:27.630
<b>and having nothing to show for it...</b>

19:28.880 --> 19:33.830
<b>I've realized the ideal that I was striving
to obtain is nothing but a pipe dream.</b>

19:33.830 --> 19:35.710
<b>How the hell is it a pipe dream?!</b>

19:36.960 --> 19:41.170
<b>You know, I thought you were
just an idiot at first.</b>

19:41.750 --> 19:44.670
<b>Suddenly inviting me on a quest
for world domination...</b>

19:44.670 --> 19:46.080
<b>you sounded crazy.</b>

19:46.420 --> 19:49.670
<b>But after we met a second time
and talked a little more,</b>

19:49.670 --> 19:52.210
<b>my perspective changed a little.</b>

19:52.210 --> 19:55.880
<b>Part of it might be due to the fact
my mom was your mentor,</b>

19:55.880 --> 19:59.750
<b>but I honestly started to believe
your way of thinking was pretty great.</b>

20:00.710 --> 20:02.580
<b>But it's just sappy nonsense.</b>

20:03.210 --> 20:06.420
<b>There could never be a world where
people live for the sake of others...</b>

20:07.420 --> 20:10.000
<b>Even so, I really liked it.</b>

20:10.630 --> 20:12.630
<b>All the stuff you said.</b>

20:12.630 --> 20:14.920
<b>W-well, that doesn't matter!</b>

20:15.920 --> 20:18.790
<b>Because there's no point in having
ambitions that can't become reality.</b>

20:20.250 --> 20:22.540
<b>Whether your ambitions are
a pipe dream or not</b>

20:22.540 --> 20:24.830
<b>is something that you have to
decide for yourself!</b>

20:25.290 --> 20:29.040
<b>And personally,
I love that pure heart of yours!</b>

20:31.540 --> 20:33.330
<b>Suck my blood.</b>

20:33.330 --> 20:34.250
<b>Huh?</b>

20:34.540 --> 20:35.460
<b>Huh?!</b>

20:35.460 --> 20:38.000
<b>I've heard one way that vampires
show their trust for each other</b>

20:38.000 --> 20:40.130
<b>is by sharing their blood.</b>

20:40.130 --> 20:43.380
<b>If you're so discouraged by the lack of
validation from those around you,</b>

20:43.380 --> 20:45.130
<b>then I'll give you my support.</b>

20:45.130 --> 20:49.130
<b>Granted, I've never done this
for anybody else before...</b>

20:50.290 --> 20:52.920
<b>But you're my friend, Nelia!</b>

20:52.920 --> 20:56.080
<b>And I'm convinced the two of us could
take over the world together!</b>

20:56.500 --> 20:58.330
<b>So do it! Suck my blood!</b>

21:00.080 --> 21:03.210
<b>S-sorry... I didn't mean to get uppity with you.</b>

21:03.210 --> 21:05.380
<b>All this blood talk is kinda gross, huh?</b>

21:06.540 --> 21:07.790
<b>No.</b>

21:09.460 --> 21:12.960
<b>I'll gladly accept the trust
you're willing to share with me.</b>

21:38.210 --> 21:40.920
<b>I have four kids of my own.</b>

21:40.920 --> 21:44.170
<b>And so far, the biggest troublemaker
is definitely the third one.</b>

21:44.630 --> 21:46.630
<b>Like you wouldn't believe.</b>

21:47.330 --> 21:49.710
<b>But despite that,
I'm positive she'll become</b>

21:49.710 --> 21:52.460
<b>a figure that drives
the Mulnite Empire someday.</b>

21:52.460 --> 21:54.580
<b>Actually, it won't stop there...</b>

21:55.420 --> 21:59.130
<b>she might even make things
hilariously exciting for the entire world.</b>

22:05.920 --> 22:07.750
<b>Diverse Divide!</b>

22:10.040 --> 22:11.420
<b>Nelia...?</b>

22:13.080 --> 22:14.710
<b>Thank you, Komari.</b>

22:14.710 --> 22:17.000
<b>It feels like something just clicked for me.</b>

22:17.290 --> 22:20.130
<b>Firstly, we need to accomplish
our original goal.</b>

22:21.960 --> 22:24.250
<b>Then we focus on killing the enemy.</b>

23:58.540 --> 24:01.000
<b>A Golden World</b>

23:58.790 --> 24:00.380
<b>"A Golden World."</b>
